  "evidencia": "Page: Amanda Duthie. Sentence: Amanda Duthie, Scottish-born Australian, is one of the leading figures in Australia's arts and culture industries and is currently the CEO/Creative Director of the Adelaide Film Festival and CEO of Hybrid World Adelaide.\nPage: Adelaide Film Festival. Sentence: The Adelaide Film Festival (AFF) is an international film festival held over two weeks in mid October, in Adelaide, South Australia.\nPage: Adelaide Film Festival. Sentence: The AFF has a strong focus on local South Australian and Australian produced content, with the Adelaide Film Festival Investment Fund (AFFIF) established to fund investment in Australian films, of $1,000,000 per festival.",
  "evidence_text": "Page: Amanda Duthie. Sentence: Amanda Duthie, Scottish-born Australian, is one of the leading figures in Australia's arts and culture industries and is currently the CEO/Creative Director of the Adelaide Film Festival and CEO of Hybrid World Adelaide.\nPage: Adelaide Film Festival. Sentence: The Adelaide Film Festival (AFF) is an international film festival held over two weeks in mid October, in Adelaide, South Australia.\nPage: Adelaide Film Festival. Sentence: The AFF has a strong focus on local South Australian and Australian produced content, with the Adelaide Film Festival Investment Fund (AFFIF) established to fund investment in Australian films, of $1,000,000 per festival.",
