        "original_id": "e03af2b8-03df-5e84-8bbe-aaa14091ea6e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Amanda Duthie\n- Organizations: Adelaide Film Festival, Hybrid World Adelaide\n- Places: Adelaide, South Australia, Australia\n- Events: Adelaide Film Festival\n- Projects: Adelaide Film Festival Investment Fund\n- Topics: Arts and culture industries, Australian film investment\n\nFacts:\n- Amanda Duthie is a Scottish-born Australian and a leading figure in Australia's arts and culture industries.\n- Amanda Duthie is the CEO and Creative Director of the Adelaide Film Festival and the CEO of Hybrid World Adelaide.\n- The Adelaide Film Festival is an international film festival held over two weeks in mid-October in Adelaide, South Australia.\n- The Adelaide Film Festival has a strong focus on local South Australian and Australian-produced content.\n- The Adelaide Film Festival Investment Fund was established by the Adelaide Film Festival to invest $1,000,000 per festival in Australian films.",
